2	line	Player	You run your claw along one of the strings like this.
2	line	Crab	Let me at it!
2	box	You place the lyre on the sand. The crab awkwardly plucks a string and a clear note rings.
2	line	Crab	That's really cool! It's a bit high-pitched, however.
1	cond	If the player has an enchanted lyre in their inventory:
2	line	Player	Well, it just so happens that I have a lyre with me right here!
