2	line	Crab	I... think I'm going to give it a pass.
2	action	continue
1	line	Crab	Can you make one that makes a nice deep sound with what you find around here? There's rubbish over there floating in the sea.
1	line	Crab	In fact, it would be great if you could clean it out, it makes the place look untidy.
1	line	Player	I'll see what I can do.
1	action	end
