0	section	Sitting by the magic tree
1	box	And now, you wait...
1	box	A crab appears!
1	line	Player	Hello! I'm looking for ceremonial leaders on behalf of my friend on the beach.
1	line	Crab	My reputation precedes me, I see? Of course you would be told to visit us. My family and I have been ceremonial leaders for generations.
1	line	Player	Indeed?
1	line	Crab	While you're here, shall I give you a tour of the estate? My lineage has been living in this magic tree for at least 200 years.
1	cond	If the player has 75 Woodcutting or higher:
2	line	Player	It's a very nice tree. I could get quite a few logs from it.
2	action	continues
1	cond	If the player doesn't have at least 75 Woodcutting:
2	line	Player	It's a very nice tree.
2	action	continues
1	cond	If the player has talked to the crab that suggests the player could be their kid:
2	line	Player	Talking to another crab, I was under the impression crabs have no idea which crab they are related to.
2	line	Crab	Oh, that is definitely true for the majority of crabs. These plebs are classless and will breed with whoever they fancy.
2	line	Crab	On the other hand, we don't mingle. Our ceremony takes place on an exclusive section of beach. We grow up in a private tide pool. Our bloodline is pure.
2	line	Player	Er...
2	action	continues
1	line	Player	Anyway, what instrument do you play?
1	line	Crab	Seashell, of course. We are not so coarse as to bash coconuts. Now playing shell... That requires some finesse that only the most delicate crab can manage.
1	line	Player	Sounds like you should play the smallest shell then. That one definitely requires finesse.
1	line	Player	If you would kindly like to make your way to the beach, you can show the other crabs how it's done.
1	line	Crab	Naturally, I will go there right away! They can't possibly get this right without some proper directions.
1	box	The crab scutters away to practise.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to the crab at practice
1	line	Player	So, how goes the practice?
1	line	Crab	Terribly. These oafs won't take my suggestions into account. I'm having to play their unrefined tune and it is most unbecoming.
1	line	Player	Actually, it sounds nice to me.
1	line	Crab	Well, of course I sound nice. I have had many years of practice. These so-and-sos, however...
1	line	Player	Hey, these are nice crabs. Try to get along or I may feel the urge to acquire some magic logs.
1	action	end
