0	section	Sitting by the palm
1	box	And now, you wait...
1	box	A crab appears!
1	line	Crab	Aaaaaaah!
1	line	Player	Hey hey! It's okay, I'm not going to hurt you.
1	line	Crab	Aaaaaah?
1	line	Player	My crab friend on the beach is looking for ceremonial leaders to join him.
1	line	Crab	That's not how it's done! There are ceremonial leaders and we pick who joins us, not the other way around.
1	line	Player	But he has a cool new instrument for himself and a collection of nice shells for other leaders.
1	line	Crab	He does? I suppose that might qualify him if he can keep a rhythm. Are any of the shells going spare?
1	line	Player	I believe so, yes. Will you be joining him?
1	line	Crab	This is highly irregular! But I suppose I should.
1	box	The crab scutters away to practise.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to the crab at practice
1	line	Player	Hey there! How's it going?
1	line	Crab	You were right, that instrument of his is pretty cool. It should be a good year.
1	action	end
0	section	Investigating the palm south-west of the magic tree
1	box	A crab appears!
1	line	Player	Hello! I'm here on behalf of my crab friend on the beach. He's looking for crabs to become ceremonial leaders.
1	line	Crab	Ceremonial leaders? Oh they are all so awesome! Putting themselves out there to make music for the ceremony like that, it's so selfless!
1	line	Crab	I like them all so much I carve their portraits on my tree. I go to all of the ceremonies. I even got a ceremonial shell once, scratched by the leader! I almost fainted!
1	line	Player	Can I convince you to join them this year?
1	line	Crab	Being among my idols would be my dream, but it would kind of ruin the magic. I prefer just being in the crowd watching the show!
1	action	end
